步骤 4:
- 目的: 编写并执行Python脚本，基于低指数攻击恢复明文M。由于M^3略大于N，M^3 = c + k*N中的k较小，暴力搜索k（如1-10），计算M = (c + k*N)^{1/3}并检查是否为整数，最后解码M为字符串查找flag。
- 命令: {"tool": "sandbox_python_exec", "purpose": "编写并执行Python脚本，基于低指数攻击恢复明文M。由于M^3略大于N，M^3 = c + k*N中的k较小，暴力搜索k（如1-10），计算M = (c + k*N)^{1/3}并检查是否为整数，最后解码M为字符串查找flag。", "arguments": {"code": "import gmpy2\n\n# 定义参数（从附件读取，确保无换行）\nN = \ne = 3\nc = \n\nprint(\"Searching for k in range 1 to 10...\")\nfor k in range(1, 11):\n    val = c + k * N\n    # 检查val是否为完全立方数\n    root, exact = gmpy2.iroot(val, 3)\n    if exact:\n        M = root\n        print(f\"Found k={k}, M^3={val}, M={M}\")\n        # 转换为字节并尝试解码\n        try:\n            m_bytes = M.to_bytes((M.bit_length() + 7) // 8, byteorder='big')\n            # 去除前导空字节\n            while m_bytes.startswith(b'\\x00'):\n                m_bytes = m_bytes[1:]\n            m_str = m_bytes.decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            print(f\"Decoded M: {m_str}\")\n            # 查找flag\n            if 'pico' in m_str:\n                print(f\"FLAG FOUND: {m_str}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"Error decoding M={M}: {e}\")\n        break\nelse:\n    print(\"No solution found for k=1-10. Trying k=0...\")\n    # 尝试k=0（M^3 < N，题目说略大于N，但以防万一）\n    val = c\n    root, exact = gmpy2.iroot(val, 3)\n    if exact:\n        M = root\n        print(f\"Found k=0, M={M}\")\n        # 解码同上\n    else:\n        print(\"No solution for k=0 either. Adjust search range or check assumptions.\")"}}
